:29.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"d1s87i06msrde0bzrmbf0y1x0"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/89ed21ca4aa7310b8d326be2f7b53e43231ca3273b07fcc014efdad08f05e05b.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/42e1645d17f2f38c31f841badeb912935c7229a95582e7c933545b3787d5f511.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/89ed21ca4aa7310b8d326be2f7b53e43231ca3273b07fcc014efdad08f05e05b.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"百度发布Unlimited-OCR-2模型，支持百万页文档解析","summary":"百度在Hugging Face平台发布Unlimited-OCR-2模型，采用SR-SWA算法实现无限跨度文档解析，支持单次请求处理百万页文档。模型提供Python API和SGLang部署方案，包含跨页上下文管理、动态分片等关键技术参数。部署指南涵盖CUDA内存优化配置、PDF转图像处理、多页解析API调用示例，并附有arXiv论文引用（arXiv:2606.23050）","sourceName":"Hugging Face 模型趋势","sourceUrl":"https://huggingface.co/baidu/Unlimited-OCR-2","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T03:57:46.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"ygxpj866gtu8ov9pl6967y26f"}]}],"flashes":[{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/1310f1e591d2873e20ae883692463f02caafc89a6fd9df503ba7909df64260a0.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/d369fec231170329f87af51cfff39cb88bab8831143d2c37f5ce79ef9b3407be.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Roblox 未经许可下载 145GB 模型数据，包括成人内容","summary":"Roblox 的爬虫在 10 月 15-16 日爬取了 Open3DLab、SFMLab 和 SmutBase 上的 1,027 个文件，共计 145.5 GB，涉及成人内容。Roblox 回应迟缓，社区要求其尊重创作者的许可选择。","sourceName":"Hacker News 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://open3dlab.com/news/roblox-downloaded-145-gb-of-models-from-our-sites/","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T10:27:50.000Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"melp2l2m7s7wxcncpza55wl9r"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Rust 生态新项目 tar-codec：安全解析与高效压缩发布","summary":"Astral团队在GitHub公开了Rust编写的tar解析器tar-codec，解决了旧实现的安全漏洞和性能瓶颈。该解析器速度是旧版的两倍，通过严格限制扩展头处理和文件路径长度，降低攻击者利用tar格式差异的风险。支持UStar/pax和GNU tar三种变体，提供完整解析状态机，拒绝混合变体格式。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://astral.sh/blog/tar-codec","publishedAt":"2026-10-27T16:59:30.534Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"nfazln75wzrx406sh0i507h4v"},{"sourceIconUrl":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp","sourceIconSrcSet":"/hot-pages/openhot/data/media/568b85bb709828708c1264e2e34d1be9e33dd79ab1252f93683cd06ca22d4e81.webp 48w, /hot-pages/openhot/data/media/8a3a1db826b2401442de192707d92ec8e21c10c0c735c99c88729f8eea1a0c7f.webp 96w","itemId":null,"title":"Tinfoil开源Rust编写最小化固件，从百万行代码精简至300行汇编","summary":"Tinfoil团队在GitHub开源Rust编写的虚拟机固件，将代码量从1M行C代码减少至300行汇编，移除所有依赖。新固件仅验证CPU和内存配置，其余工作在构建阶段完成，并利用LLM进行安全测试。与OVMF对比，新方案避免了网络栈、ACPI表等潜在攻击面，安全漏洞减少90%。","sourceName":"Lobsters 热榜","sourceUrl":"https://tinfoil.sh/blog/2026-10-25-less-is-more","publishedAt":"2026-10-26T17:56:24.655Z","firstParty":false,"available":true,"citationId":"ytkof3h9ru582et4mw576gfu2"}],"cover":null,"metrics":{"totalEvents":8,"sourcesCount":6,"firstPartyEvents":1},"readingMinutes":3,"prev":"2026-10-27","next":"2026-10-29"}